  m_text: 'Welcome to Chewinggum-Delivery!

    I''ve heard that you signed up for
    this dangerous job. My name is Gumer Gumering Gumerton but you can call me Gum.
    I''ve quit this job because it''s too hard - now you need to replace me. So let''s
    get starting!

